":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪の初日から\n今日の公演を終えて\n私の中でいろんなことが変わって見えて\nいろいろなことを思いました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1つも悔いはなく\n毎公演とにかくたのしかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっといろいろ感じて思って\n書きたいところだけど\n時間がせまってて書ききれないので\nまたかくねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/19/1838639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/19/1838639/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふへへへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/19/1838639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短くてすみません。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたのサマーランドでの\nFMヨコハマさんの公開ラジオ収録\nお時間があれば来てくださいねっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろな企画があるからおたのしみに！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩とひめちゃんよろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に私の好きな角度のまいちゅんを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特別にみなさんにも見せてあげま